#: applications/luci-app-nginx-reverseproxy/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nginx-reverseproxy/users.js:19
msgid ""
"Users allowed to access proxies that have basic authentication enabled (see "
"the Proxies tab). Use \"Add user\" to open the form and its Save button to "
"store the user, then assign it to a proxy under \"Allowed users\". Passwords "
"are never stored in plain text: on save the entered password is converted to "
"an $apr1$ hash (password_hash) in the UCI config; only the hash reaches the "
"nginx htpasswd file. On Save & Apply the htpasswd files are regenerated (no "
"nginx reload needed — they are read per request)."
msgstr ""

